{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "iris.rincon.modules-contract/2.1.2",
  "title": "Rincón tranquilo · contrato de módulos y medios v2.1.2 (compatibilidad R32 + publication gate media)",
  "$defs": {
    "status_module": {
      "enum": [
        "PUBLIC",
        "PENDING_REVIEW"
      ]
    },
    "status_media": {
      "enum": [
        "PUBLIC",
        "PENDING_REVIEW",
        "MISSING_FILE"
      ]
    },
    "review": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "decided_by",
        "decided_on",
        "evidence",
        "checklist"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "decided_by": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "decided_on": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "evidence": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "checklist": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "module": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "id",
        "orden",
        "status",
        "label_es",
        "label_en"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "enum": [
            "calm-entry",
            "still",
            "help",
            "local-sound",
            "pause",
            "grounding",
            "show-card",
            "watch",
            "listen",
            "clean-screen"
          ]
        },
        "orden": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "status": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/status_module"
        },
        "label_es": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "label_en": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "clean_screen": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "depends_on_media": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "copy_ref": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "ui": {
          "type": "object"
        },
        "review": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/review"
        }
      },
      "$comment": "v2.1.2: los módulos son contenedores funcionales y se validan por QA de producto/copy. El objeto review es opcional en módulos. El gate editorial obligatorio de license/provenance/transcript/captions/review se aplica a recursos media PUBLIC. Esto preserva los módulos PUBLIC heredados de R32 sin inventar metadatos."
    },
    "media": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "id",
        "module",
        "type",
        "status",
        "license",
        "accessibility",
        "provenance"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "module": {
          "enum": [
            "watch",
            "listen"
          ]
        },
        "type": {
          "enum": [
            "video",
            "audio"
          ]
        },
        "status": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/status_media"
        },
        "license": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "accessibility": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {},
          "additionalProperties": true
        },
        "provenance": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": true
        },
        "review": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/review"
        }
      },
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "status": {
            "const": "PUBLIC"
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "required": [
          "review"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "license": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "not": {
              "const": "UNKNOWN"
            }
          },
          "provenance": {
            "type": "object",
            "minProperties": 1
          },
          "review": {
            "properties": {
              "decided_by": {
                "minLength": 1
              },
              "decided_on": {
                "minLength": 10
              },
              "evidence": {
                "minItems": 1
              },
              "checklist": {
                "minItems": 1
              }
            }
          },
          "accessibility": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "transcript": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1,
                "not": {
                  "const": "UNKNOWN"
                }
              },
              "has_captions": {
                "anyOf": [
                  {
                    "type": "boolean"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "not": {
                      "const": "UNKNOWN"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "allOf": [
          {
            "if": {
              "properties": {
                "type": {
                  "const": "video"
                }
              }
            },
            "then": {
              "properties": {
                "accessibility": {
                  "required": [
                    "transcript",
                    "has_captions"
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "if": {
              "properties": {
                "type": {
                  "const": "audio"
                }
              }
            },
            "then": {
              "properties": {
                "accessibility": {
                  "required": [
                    "transcript"
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "$comment": "Astra v2.1: PUBLIC exige presencia explícita de transcript; vídeo exige además has_captions. has_captions=false solo es aceptable cuando review.evidence documenta ausencia de audio relevante/alternativa aplicable. El schema no puede demostrar por sí solo esa evidencia editorial. v2.1.1: las restricciones «no UNKNOWN» de transcript/has_captions solo aplican con status PUBLIC; en PENDING_REVIEW/MISSING_FILE se conserva UNKNOWN (R32). v2.1.2: el cambio de 2.1.1→2.1.2 NO altera ningún gate de media PUBLIC; solo corrige el sobrealcance de review en $defs.module."
    }
  },
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "modules",
    "media"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "modules": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/module"
      }
    },
    "media": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/media"
      }
    }
  }
}
